    "Visually inspected original Volkswagen P1545 bulletin pages1and5, Audi P1545 bulletin pages1,2and4, and Volkswagen P1624 Tech Tip pages1and2. Applicability tables, fault descriptions and conditional repair sequence checked.",
    "No guessed pinouts, measurements, warranty coverage, code-specific model matrices, part prices, universal transfer functions or human technician approval. One pin/location detail in P1624 is directly supported by the scoped Volkswagen Tech Tip.",
    "Copied OEM tables, raw source HTML/wikitext and full PDFs are retained only in scratch; repository contains original article explanations, source metadata and links."
  ],
